          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After Yi Tian Mountain, the sword path Immortal Gu are refined under the light of wisdom and become Fang Yuan’s. He holds Sword Escape Immortal Gu in one hand and this Gu in the other: the pair show rank seven aura, and this one is named Bo Qing’s most used offensive and defensive Gu worm in that stretch.",
        "chapters": [
          1033
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "yi-tian-mountain-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
          "gu_sword_escape_immortal_gu",
          "sys_defensive_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It stays in Chu Du’s keeping, and Fang Yuan hands its feeding over to Chu Du, who covets Fang Yuan’s tribulation technique.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
